# DISCLAIMER

## Educational Use Only

This software (cookielog) is provided for **educational purposes only** — specifically for
security research, penetration testing training, red-team exercises, and learning how
cookie-stealing attacks work so that defenders can build detection and mitigation.

## What This Tool Does

cookielog builds an infected executable that, when run:

1. Opens the original host application normally (the victim sees nothing wrong)
2. Silently extracts browser cookies (Chrome, Edge, Brave, Vivaldi, Opera, Firefox)
3. Exfiltrates the cookies via HTTP POST to an attacker-controlled server

